  "description": "Hangyeom, who was an ordinary college student, has the ability to have lucid dreams as he wishes for some reason and dreams of sharing a relationship with his unrequited love partner, Lee Jun. \n\nAt the same time, the contents of his dream were shared with Jun Lee, and Jun Lee was confused about his identity and encountered him at the bar where he worked. Later, after learning that he was attending the same college, Lee Joon wondered about the relationship between his dream and a man, and suggested to make a relationship with himself... \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
